  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Sign\n -\n ÷\n ×\n +\n \n \n\n Stands For\n ÷\n ×\n +\n -\n \n \n\nGiven: 5 × 39 ÷ 1407 − 3 + 11562 = ?\n\n5 × 39 ÷ 1407 − 3 + 11562 = ? ⇒ 5 + 39 × 1407 ÷ 3 - 11562 = ?\n\n⇒ 5 + 39 × __**1407 **____**÷**____** 3**__ - 11562 = ?\n\n⇒ 5 + __**39 **____**× 469**__ - 11562 = ?\n\n⇒ __**5 + 18291**__ - 11562 = ?\n\n⇒ __**18296**____** - 11562**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 6734 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
